I was known in the business cast new directors new me, a couple, couple showrunners new me.
我在商业界广为人知，新的导演让我焕然一新，一对夫妇、几位制片人也让我焕然一新。

00:46:16.062 --> 00:46:20.459
But I had gotten a reputation as being like a little picky as a young actor.
但作为一名年轻演员，我被认为有点挑剔。

00:46:20.459 --> 00:46:22.368
And I remember Megan had pitched.
我记得梅根已经投过球了。

