我不知道他是否会进来。

00:46:27.849 --> 00:46:28.929
He's picky.
他很挑剔。

00:46:28.929 --> 00:46:34.730
So when you saw me on the list, you're like, oh, Josh Radder's going like, we thought accepted by you.
所以当你在名单上看到我时，你会想，哦，乔什·拉德（Josh Radder）会这样，我们认为你已经接受了。

00:46:34.730 --> 00:46:35.730
We were like, he liked us.
我们就像，他喜欢我们。

00:46:35.730 --> 00:46:36.730
The picky guy liked us.
那个挑剔的家伙喜欢我们。

00:46:36.730 --> 00:46:37.730
Yeah.
是的。

00:46:37.730 --> 00:46:38.730
We're so needy.
我们太需要了

00:46:38.730 --> 00:46:47.929
So that was a real gift my agent gave me was saying, like, be discerning, you know, so I would only throw my hat in the rings for stuff I really believed in.
所以这是我的经纪人给我的一份真正的礼物，就是说，要有洞察力，你知道，所以我只会为我真正相信的东西而努力。

00:46:47.929 --> 00:46:49.650
And I believed in your show.
我相信你的表演。

00:46:49.650 --> 00:46:53.889
By the time I got back to the car, my agent called me and said, well, that was quick.
当我回到车上时，我的经纪人打电话给我说，好吧，那很快。

00:46:53.889 --> 00:46:56.130
they want to do a test deal with you.
他们想与你进行测试交易。

00:46:56.130 --> 00:46:57.650
They want to take you to the studio.
他们想带你去工作室。

00:46:57.650 --> 00:46:58.889
Your car was 10 feet away.
你的车在 10 英尺外。

00:46:58.889 --> 00:47:05.099
So then you guys also had a couple more days of seeing other teds, right?
那么你们还有几天时间去看其他的 teds，对吧？

