And now people years and years later and people who are 19 years old and trying and going through their own hard time are feeling that in the show and it just makes me feel like we baked, we baked something in there that's lasting.
现在，很多年过去了，那些19岁的人，正在努力，正在经历自己的艰难时刻，他们在节目中感受到了，这让我觉得我们烘焙了，我们在那里烘焙了一些持久的东西。

01:10:21.779 --> 01:10:39.981
And also this notion of watching characters go through hard times with this sense of chosen family and community and that they landed on their feet and they were able to laugh in the midst of hard times.
还有这种观看角色经历困难时期的观念，带着这种选择家庭和社区的感觉，他们站起来，能够在困难时期欢笑。

01:10:39.981 --> 01:10:59.170
Like how am I my mother was still, it was brightly lit, it was trot on a soundstage, there's laughter piped in, it was a fantasy but it also So it was attempting to gesture at something very true about being alive.
就像我妈妈一动不动一样，它灯火通明，在摄影棚里小跑，有笑声传来，这是一个幻想，但它也是如此，所以它试图表达一些关于活着的非常真实的东西。

